docs {
  # Mini Wallet API v1

  Requests are run in order: a session is started as Ana (`ana@example.com`), the session cookie is
  kept by Bruno and sent with every following request, and the session is ended last.

  Outcomes of the mock payment network are random, so a scenario is forced with the
  `x-mock-scenario` header wherever a specific outcome is asserted. Overrides are honored outside
  production (`MOCK_SCENARIO_OVERRIDE`).
}
